'''Cruel Angel Clionel''' (断罪天使クオリネル, ''Danzai Tenshi Kuorineru'', '''Condemnation Angel Kuolinel''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Cli-One]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[No Plan A (Deadly)|Clionel Ascendant]]. She was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

