==Enemy==
Cruel Angel Clionel has very high damage and attacks rapidly as opposed to [[Cli-One]], with a chance to slow anything that survives. Her Long Distance attack has a very wide area of effect, to the extent where even outranging her isn't an option. Though she has a sizable blind spot, almost all of her appearances pair her with enemies that cover it, forming exceptionally lethal synergies, such as with [[Angelic Sleipnir]], [[Relic Doge]], [[Hannya]] and [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]].

==Strategy==
When fighting Clionel, use units that are able to easily withstand her attacks or can quickly get into her blind spot, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Delivery Cat]] and [[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|Guardian Gamereon]]. [[Asiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Assassinlan Pasalan]] and a few others can barely outrange Clionel (1250 > 1200), but in general they are only useful in a supportive role.

